1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,614
The others fail too.

2
00:00:01,614 --> 00:00:07,213
Concentrated hydrochloric acid gives off fumes, so its strength drifts.

3
00:00:07,213 --> 00:00:18,385
Potassium permanganate always contains a little manganese dioxide and is slowly reduced by traces of organic matter, so we standardise it freshly against oxalic acid.

